      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a questionthe  update where they raise the max megabytes of what can be seen was very big for us because since were able to see up to 100 MB a lot of options for avatars that I couldn’t see were unlocked and I enjoyed it a lot\n\nand since that feature was taken away and capped at 10 MB, it is like we are being limited again we arealready limited. As questie to what we can see and for you guys to take it away from us. Once again, it’s just plain rude, and makes people like me and my friends no longer want to play VR chat because the amount of limitation’s quest his deal with on a daily basis lplease ask you to  re-add this feature back on and allow questies to see as they once did before if people decide to raise their max avatar download size that is their own decision and doing you guys do not need to limit or cap them for noreason so please add this feature back ono",
